;; Crash-isolation shells: menu targets with NO collections (static UI only).

[Report : PW Safe Claim Verification List]
Use : DSP Template
Form : PW Safe CV Form
Title : "Claim Verification List (PesoWise)"

[Form : PW Safe CV Form]
Part : PW Safe CV Part
Height : 100 % Screen
Width : 100 % Screen

[Part : PW Safe CV Part]
Lines : PW Safe CV T, PW Safe CV M
[Line : PW Safe CV T]
Field : PW Safe CV TF
[Field : PW Safe CV TF]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Claim Verification List"
Full Width : Yes
[Line : PW Safe CV M]
Field : PW Safe CV MF
[Field : PW Safe CV MF]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Safe shell — no ledger collection. Load PesoWise-Reports.tdl for data rows after stability check."
Full Width : Yes

